--- CPU Key Insights ---
- SPECK ECB vs PRESENT ECB:  225.5 / 2.4  = ~94x faster  (ARX vs bit-permutation in software)
- SPECK ECB vs AES ECB:      225.5 / 10.6 = ~21x faster  (ARX vs table-based MixColumns, no AES-NI)
- AES ECB vs PRESENT ECB:     10.6 / 2.4  =  ~4x faster  (PRESENT designed for HW, not SW)
- AES KS cyc vs SPECK:         553 vs ~0   = SPECK KS essentially free (reuses round function)

